        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shrewsbury%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Paul Smith Library of Southern York County, located in Shrewsbury, offers a rich collection for locals and visitors.",
